---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import { SITE_NAME, CONTACT_EMAIL } from '../consts';
---

<Page title="Privacy Policy" description={`How ${SITE_NAME} handles your information.`}>
  <!-- TODO: update this if you add analytics, ads, or an email newsletter. -->
  <p class="muted">Last updated October 4, 2026</p>
  <p>
    {SITE_NAME} doesn't ask you to create an account and doesn't collect personal information through forms.
  </p>
  <h2>Hosting and server logs</h2>
  <p>
    Like most websites, our hosting provider may automatically log basic technical information, such as your IP address,
    browser type, and the pages you visit, to keep the site secure and running.
  </p>
  <h2>Affiliate links and cookies</h2>
  <p>
    When you click an affiliate link, the retailer (for example, Amazon) may set cookies so it can credit us for the
    referral. Those cookies are governed by the retailer's own privacy policy.
  </p>
  <h2>Fonts</h2>
  <p>Our fonts load from Google Fonts, which means your browser connects to Google's servers to download them.</p>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions? Email <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>.</p>
</Page>
